{
  "slug": "claude-telegram-voice-control",
  "name": "Claude Telegram Voice Control",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Telegram channel with local voice transcription via whisper.cpp. Voice messages are automatically transcribed on-device using the Whisper medium model before being forwarded to Claude — no external APIs, no data leaves the machine. Cross-platform auto-install of whisper-cpp and ffmpeg. Gracefully degrades to standard behavior when dependencies are unavailable.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `access` (Manage Telegram channel access — approve pairings, edit allowlists, set DM/group policy), `configure` (Set up the Telegram channel — save the bot token and review access policy)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `telegram`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-telegram-voice-control@claude-community` from `codefather-labs/claude-telegram-voice-control`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
